<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		The Stoneborn outlander faction requires the Craft culture meme (VIE - Memes and Structures).

		This folder loads only when Det's Xenotypes - Stoneborn and VIE - Memes and Structures are both active
		(see loadFolders.xml).

		Verified against the current 1.6 release: OutlanderRoughStoneborn has no requiredMemes, so the meme is added,
		not replaced. Nothing here duplicates upstream.

		Split by category into the MMMM Integrations sub-mods: this copy holds only the Factions ops (factions, pawn kinds, traders and royal titles).
		Moved 2026-10-05: the TMM_Dwarven culture assignments (Stoneborn outlanders, Little People) now live with the
		culture itself in MMMM Integrations - Ideology, since they do nothing without its CultureDef.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>

			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd" MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VMemesE,det.stoneborn">
				<xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="OutlanderRoughStoneborn"]/requiredMemes</xpath>
				<value>
					<li>VME_CraftCulture</li>
				</value>
			</li>

		</operations>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
